# Render texture cameras and the main camera (run with RenderTextureOrderTest.lvl):
#   ./.build/Editor_Debug/Havana --scene Assets/Scenes/Tests/RenderTextureOrderTest.lvl --editor-exec Assets/Scenes/Tests/RenderTextureOrderFlows.edscript
# The feed camera is listed first and no camera says IsCurrent: the plain camera still becomes the main
# camera (CameraCore skips cameras with a target when it picks one), and the feed renders.
wait 20
assert-field Plain Camera | Camera.IsCurrent | true
assert-field Feed Camera | Camera.IsCurrent | false
rtt-wait @Feed Camera
rtt-assert-lit @Feed Camera | 0.5
